sed fuel consumption Increased engine wear from particles</p></div></div></div></li><li><div id="accordion-track-routine"><h3>When should I change the Oil in my car?</h3></div><div class="clearfix"><div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " ><div class="wpb_wrapper"><p>Oil acts as a barrier between engine parts, preventing metal-to-metal brushing and keeping the engine running quietly. The engine noise will rise if your oil isn&#8217;t doing its job properly. You may even hear knocking or rumbling sounds, which indicate that your engine is slowly tearing itself apart due to a lack of oil.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div>',
